Familiar Origin 0.1.3 is an original generated research prototype.

The repository contains no intentionally copied third-party kernel source. It
depends on standard external tools and emulated firmware for development/testing.
GCC/binutils, Python and QEMU are separate third-party projects subject to their
respective licenses. GCC and QEMU binaries are not included.

The optional browser VM in browser-site/dist/vendor/ redistributes these
unmodified third-party files:

- v86 0.5.473 (commit 315b2b0): libv86.js, libv86.mjs, v86.wasm and
  v86-fallback.wasm. BSD-2-Clause. They include QEMU-derived code under the MIT
  license, Berkeley SoftFloat 3e, the Zstandard decompressor (used under its BSD
  license) and the Rust standard library (MIT or Apache-2.0).
- Debian seabios 1.16.3-2: seabios.bin (bios-256k.bin) and vgabios.bin
  (vgabios-stdvga.bin). LGPL version 3, with one source file under LGPL version 2.

Their license texts, notices and corresponding source archives are in the same
folder and are listed on browser-site/dist/licenses.html.

The owner has not selected an open-source license for this new repository.
